&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;With over 50 nationalities represented, we’re proud to welcome people of all backgrounds to our growing community. Here, you’ll have the tools, training and support you need to work in a way that suits you, learn new skills and reach your potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For a career where you can drive our business and shape your future, apply now.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; Find more  English Speaking Jobs in Germany  on Arbeitnow

&lt;p lang=&quot;de&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A&amp;nbsp;career&amp;nbsp;driven&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Join&amp;nbsp;AutoScout24 Group and&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;life&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;fast&amp;nbsp;lane.&amp;nbsp;We’re&amp;nbsp;not&amp;nbsp;just&amp;nbsp;leading&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;market;&amp;nbsp;we’re&amp;nbsp;creating&amp;nbsp;it.&amp;nbsp;We’re&amp;nbsp;constantly&amp;nbsp;innovating,&amp;nbsp;evolving&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;transforming&amp;nbsp;things&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;customers.&amp;nbsp;We’re&amp;nbsp;driven,&amp;nbsp;ambitious&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;determined&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;do&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;best&amp;nbsp;work,&amp;nbsp;together.&amp;nbsp;For&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;career&amp;nbsp;that&amp;nbsp;doesn’t&amp;nbsp;stand still,&amp;nbsp;where&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;can&amp;nbsp;put&amp;nbsp;your&amp;nbsp;ideasin&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;driving&amp;nbsp;seat&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;change&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;way&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;world&amp;nbsp;moves,&amp;nbsp;join&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;global&amp;nbsp;community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring a Software Engineer to join Search &amp;amp; Performance group at AutoScout24 – the group behind the Algorithms and Data Quality that powers the AutoScout24 Search Experience and Ad Products. This role is about real ownership: you’ll work on high-traffic systems, shape key parts of our user experience, and contribute to critical business outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-GB&quot;&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-GB&quot;&gt;Work on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;product and tech initiatives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;finding the right mix between&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;effort&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;user value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
