&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-GB&quot;&gt;Deep expertise in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;Java&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;Spring Boot&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;, with a breadth of knowledge across a range of languages and technologies in both&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;Object-Oriented&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;Functional&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;paradigms; able to quickly grasp new concepts and tools Experience with&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;Scala&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;is a plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
